# Wanted (IDEAS I20 c, I17, I25 a; QUESTIONS Q20 and Q29, 4; board 0.5). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up.
# Story: three windows lie about. One is docked. The other two stay exactly as they are: same place, same size. Then the docked
# one fills the screen: the two are still where they were, behind it, and not sent out of view.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
move 102 500 200 640 420
move 103 700 350 640 420
dock 101 left
expect still 102
expect still 103
expect at 102 500 200
expect size 102 640x420
expect at 103 700 350
expect size 103 640x420
zoom 101
expect fills 101
expect still 102
expect still 103
expect at 102 500 200
expect at 103 700 350
zoom 101
expect still 102
expect still 103
